# Тестирование

## Текущее состояние
**Тесты отсутствуют** во всех частях проекта. Ниже — стратегия добавления тестов.

## Backend (Python) — pytest + httpx

### Структура
```
backend/
├── tests/
│   ├── conftest.py          # Fixtures: test DB, test client
│   ├── test_auth.py         # Тесты авторизации
│   ├── test_equipment.py    # Тесты оборудования
│   ├── test_inspections.py  # Тесты обследований
│   └── test_reports.py      # Тесты отчётов
```

### conftest.py
```python
import pytest
from httpx import AsyncClient, ASGITransport
from main import app

@pytest.fixture
async def client():
    transport = ASGITransport(app=app)
    async with AsyncClient(transport=transport, base_url="http://test") as ac:
        yield ac

@pytest.fixture
async def auth_headers(client):
    response = await client.post("/api/auth/login", json={
        "username": "admin", "password": "test"
    })
    token = response.json()["access_token"]
    return {"Authorization": f"Bearer {token}"}
```

### Пример теста
```python
import pytest

@pytest.mark.asyncio
async def test_list_equipment(client, auth_headers):
    response = await client.get("/api/equipment", headers=auth_headers)
    assert response.status_code == 200
    assert isinstance(response.json(), list)

@pytest.mark.asyncio
async def test_unauthorized_access(client):
    response = await client.get("/api/equipment")
    assert response.status_code == 401
```

### Запуск
```bash
cd backend
pip install pytest pytest-asyncio httpx
pytest -v
```

## Frontend (React) — Vitest + Testing Library

### Структура
```
__tests__/
├── pages/
│   ├── Dashboard.test.tsx
│   └── Login.test.tsx
├── components/
│   ├── ProtectedRoute.test.tsx
│   └── ConfirmModal.test.tsx
└── utils/
    ├── cache.test.ts
    └── apiWithRetry.test.ts
```

### Настройка (vite.config.ts)
```typescript
export default defineConfig({
  plugins: [react()],
  test: {
    globals: true,
    environment: 'jsdom',
    setupFiles: './test/setup.ts',
  },
});
```

### Зависимости
```bash
npm install -D vitest @testing-library/react @testing-library/jest-dom jsdom
```

